{{!--
  WARRANTY CERTIFICATE — new design (D-1 pilot)
  ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  Replaces the old html2canvas + inline-styled cert. Reads from the
  shared design system; the brand-band top + seal-footer are
  inherited from _layout.hbs so EVERY doc shares the same chrome.

  Layout philosophy:
    - One commanding hero on page 1: "Lifetime Warranty"
    - Tier badge as a small, calm typographic moment (not screaming)
    - Property block as a 2-col key/value grid with hairline rules
    - Guarantee terms in a pull-block with orange accent rail
    - Feature list as a 2-col grid with dot bullets
    - Signature block at the foot of the doc with two lines

  Required template variables:
    owner, address, dateFormatted, work,
    tier (economy|standard|preferred|elite|beyond),
    tierLabel, tierLabelLong, tierTerms, certNumber, isElite, isPreferred,
    isEconomy, isBeyond

  Five tiers (Jo, 2026-10-02): Economy is a 1-YEAR labor warranty + the
  shingle manufacturer's standard limited warranty, no system warranty — it
  never prints the Lifetime Pledge. Beyond is Elite's terms (isElite is true)
  plus TAMKO's HailGuard hail warranty.
--}}

{{!-- D-2.5: shared cover-page partial. Brand-consistent across every
     doc the platform produces; the variables here personalize the
     SAME structure to THIS customer + THIS project.
     gauntlet Batch 3: the `sub` copy names the pledge, so it is gated on
     company.isNbd — NBD keeps the exact "NBD Lifetime Pledge" wording
     byte-identical; a stranger tenant renders the neutral "Lifetime Pledge"
     so the cert never advertises NBD to another company's homeowner. --}}
{{#if isEconomy}}
{{> coverPage
  eyebrow="Warranty Certificate · 1-Year Labor Warranty"
  tagline="Backed by our<br>name on the line."
  sub="This certificate is the homeowner's record that the installation on the property below carries a one-year labor (workmanship) warranty from the installation date. The shingles carry the manufacturer's standard limited warranty; no system warranty is included. Keep it with your important home documents."
  preparedFor=preparedFor
  preparedBy=preparedBy
  projectMeta=projectMeta
}}
{{else if company.isNbd}}
{{> coverPage
  eyebrow="Warranty Certificate · Lifetime Pledge"
  tagline="Backed by our<br>name on the line."
  sub="This certificate is the homeowner's permanent record that the installation on the property below is covered by the NBD Lifetime Pledge. Keep it with your important home documents — and if you ever sell, transfer it per the terms below."
  preparedFor=preparedFor
  preparedBy=preparedBy
  projectMeta=projectMeta
}}
{{else}}
{{> coverPage
  eyebrow="Warranty Certificate · Lifetime Pledge"
  tagline="Backed by our<br>name on the line."
  sub="This certificate is the homeowner's permanent record that the installation on the property below is covered by the Lifetime Pledge. Keep it with your important home documents — and if you ever sell, transfer it per the terms below."
  preparedFor=preparedFor
  preparedBy=preparedBy
  projectMeta=projectMeta
}}
{{/if}}

<div style="display:flex; align-items:center; gap:12pt; margin: var(--s-6) 0 var(--s-5); page-break-before: always; break-before: page;">
  {{#if isEconomy}}
  <span class="badge tier-{{tier}}">{{tier}} · 1-Year Labor Warranty</span>
  {{else}}
  <span class="badge tier-{{tier}}">{{tier}} · {{#if company.seal}}{{company.seal}} {{/if}}Lifetime Pledge</span>
  {{/if}}
  <span class="eyebrow muted">Certificate {{certNumber}}</span>
</div>

<h2>Property &amp; Installation</h2>
<div class="kv-grid">
  <div class="kv span-2">
    <div class="kv-label">Property Address</div>
    <div class="kv-value">{{address}}</div>
  </div>
  <div class="kv">
    <div class="kv-label">Homeowner of Record</div>
    <div class="kv-value">{{owner}}</div>
  </div>
  <div class="kv">
    <div class="kv-label">Installation Date</div>
    <div class="kv-value">{{dateFormatted}}</div>
  </div>
  <div class="kv span-2">
    <div class="kv-label">Work Performed</div>
    <div class="kv-value">{{work}}</div>
  </div>
</div>

<h2>What's Guaranteed</h2>
<div class="pull">
  <div>
    <div class="pull-title">{{tierLabelLong}}</div>
    <div class="pull-body">{{tierTerms}}</div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="feature-grid">
  {{#if isEconomy}}
  <div class="feature">1-year labor warranty from the installation date</div>
  <div class="feature">Shingle manufacturer's standard limited warranty (no system warranty)</div>
  {{else}}
  <div class="feature">{{#if company.seal}}{{company.seal}} {{/if}}Lifetime Pledge — no expiration on labor warranty</div>
  <div class="feature">{{#if manufacturerWarrantyFeature}}{{manufacturerWarrantyFeature}}{{else}}GAF Timberline lifetime manufacturer shingle warranty{{/if}}</div>
  {{/if}}
  {{#if isPreferred}}<div class="feature">Transferable to new owner on sale of property</div>{{/if}}
  {{#if isElite}}<div class="feature">Annual courtesy inspection included</div>{{/if}}
  {{#if isElite}}<div class="feature">Fully transferable — follows the property through all subsequent owners</div>{{/if}}
  {{#if company.isNbd}}<div class="feature">Backed personally by Joe Deal</div>{{else}}<div class="feature">Backed by {{company.footerName}}</div>{{/if}}
  {{#if company.isNbd}}<div class="feature">Recorded on file at NBD Home Solutions</div>{{else}}<div class="feature">Recorded on file at {{company.footerName}}</div>{{/if}}
</div>

<p class="meta" style="margin-top:18pt; line-height:1.6;">This guarantee covers defects in labor and workmanship only. It does not cover damage caused by acts of nature, severe weather events, improper maintenance, or modifications made by parties other than {{company.footerName}}. {{#if isEconomy}}The shingle manufacturer's standard limited warranty is a separate warranty provided directly by the manufacturer and is not administered by {{company.footerName}}.{{else}}The {{#if manufacturer}}{{manufacturer}}{{else}}GAF{{/if}} manufacturer shingle warranty{{#if isBeyond}} (including the HailGuard hail warranty){{/if}} is a separate warranty provided directly by {{#if manufacturer}}{{manufacturer}}{{else}}GAF{{/if}} and is not administered by {{company.footerName}}.{{/if}}</p>

<div class="sig-block">
  <h2 style="margin-top:0;">Signatures</h2>
  <div class="sig-grid">
    <div class="sig">
      <div class="sig-line"></div>
      <div class="sig-caption">Homeowner Signature &amp; Date</div>
    </div>
    <div class="sig">
      <div class="sig-line"></div>
      <div class="sig-caption">{{#if company.isNbd}}Joe Deal{{else}}{{preparedBy.name}}{{/if}} · {{company.footerName}}</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

{{> affiliateRow}}
